---
layout: layouts/tool.njk
toolSlug: discount-calculator
permalink: /tools/discount-calculator/
extraCss: "/tools/discount-calculator/style.css"
lastReviewed: "2026-10-24"
---
{% from "partials/currency-select.njk" import currencySelect, countryData with context %}
{{ countryData(countries) }}

    <!-- Tool Form Container -->
    <section class="tool-container" aria-label="{{ 'ariaLabel.tool-section1' | pt }}">
      <form id="calculator-form" novalidate>
        <div class="form-grid two-col">
          
          {{ currencySelect({ id: "currency-symbol", param: "cur", selected: "USD" }) }}

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="original-price">{{ 'label.original-price' | pt }}</label>
            <input type="number" step="any" id="original-price" data-param="price" class="form-control" placeholder="{{ 'placeholder.original-price' | pt }}" required aria-required="true">
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="discount-percent">{{ 'label.discount-percent' | pt }}</label>
            <input type="number" step="any" id="discount-percent" data-param="off" data-param-alias="disc" class="form-control" placeholder="{{ 'placeholder.discount-percent' | pt }}" required aria-required="true">
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="stacked-discount-percent">{{ 'label.stacked-discount-percent' | pt }}</label>
            <input type="number" step="any" id="stacked-discount-percent" data-param="off2" data-param-alias="stacked" class="form-control" placeholder="{{ 'placeholder.stacked-discount-percent' | pt }}">
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="tax-percent">{{ 'label.tax-percent' | pt }}</label>
            <input type="number" step="any" id="tax-percent" data-param="tax" class="form-control" placeholder="{{ 'placeholder.tax-percent' | pt }}">
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="button-group mt-6">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">{{ 'content.tool.button1' | pt }}</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="reset-btn">{{ 'text.reset-btn' | pt }}</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="error-box" class="hidden form-error" role="alert"></div>

      <!-- Result Box -->
      <div id="result-box" class="result-box is-visible" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="result-header">
          <span id="result-header-text">{{ 'text.result-header-text' | pt }}</span>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" id="copy-result-btn" title="{{ 'title.copy-result-btn' | pt }}" aria-label="{{ 'ariaLabel.copy-result-btn' | pt }}">
            {{ 'text.copy-result-btn' | pt }}
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="result-primary" id="result-primary-text">{{ 'text.result-primary-text' | pt }}</div>
        
        <div class="result-grid">
          <div class="result-stat-card">
            <div class="result-stat-label">{{ 'content.tool.div1' | pt }}</div>
            <div class="result-stat-value" id="stat-final-price">$0.00</div>
          </div>
          <div class="result-stat-card">
            <div class="result-stat-label">{{ 'content.tool.div2' | pt }}</div>
            <div class="result-stat-value" id="stat-total-saved">$0.00</div>
          </div>
          <div class="result-stat-card">
            <div class="result-stat-label">{{ 'content.tool.div3' | pt }}</div>
            <div class="result-stat-value" id="stat-price-before-tax">$0.00</div>
          </div>
          <div class="result-stat-card">
            <div class="result-stat-label">{{ 'content.tool.div4' | pt }}</div>
            <div class="result-stat-value" id="stat-tax-amount">$0.00</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="formula-box content-panel" id="formula-breakdown-box">
          <!-- Step-by-step breakdown inserted by script.js -->
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- tool-end -->

    <!-- When to Use Section -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>{{ 'content.how-when-to-use-the-discount.heading' | pt }}</h2>
      <ul class="content-list">
        <li>{{ 'content.how-when-to-use-the-discount.li1' | pt }}</li>
        <li>{{ 'content.how-when-to-use-the-discount.li2' | pt }}</li>
        <li>{{ 'content.how-when-to-use-the-discount.li3' | pt }}</li>
        <li>{{ 'content.how-when-to-use-the-discount.li4' | pt }}</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
